# Implementation Plan - Hyper-Accurate Real-Time Telemetry & Lag Elimination

Fixing real-time position delay, hardware timestamp parsing, 0ms telemetry bridge synchronization, and high-speed trajectory dead-reckoning snapping so our map marker matches the official Margdarshi mobile app with zero lag.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Immediate 0ms Live Sync**: Live bus updates will be pushed to the Admin UI map **immediately upon receipt of the API payload** (0ms delay), rather than waiting for 35 seconds of database batch processing.
> - **Hardware Timestamp Mapping**: `parseMargdarshiBus` will map `DeviceDatetime` / `st_timestamp` / `gpstime` directly from Margdarshi API to accurately reflect true bus hardware time.
> - **High-Speed Dead-Reckoning Snap**: For buses moving at highway speeds (`speed > 40 km/h`), trajectory catch-up speed will be increased from `0.008` to `0.08` so markers instantly catch up to actual high-speed positions.

